# Lab 4 style REST Client requests for local Express services.
# Run `npm run dev` first. Change the @baseUrl value to switch services.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001

### T01 View drives — expect 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/drives
Accept: application/json

### T02 Drive health — expect 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health/drive
Accept: application/json

### T03 Invalid create drive — expect 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/drives
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_ORGANIZER_TOKEN

{}
### T04 Unknown route — expect 404 NOT_FOUND
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/does-not-exist
Accept: application/json

### T05 Malformed JSON — expect 400 MALFORMED_JSON
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/drives
Content-Type: application/json

{
### T06 CORS preflight — expect ACAO http://localhost:8090
OPTIONS {{baseUrl}}/api/drives
Origin: http://localhost:8090
Access-Control-Request-Method: GET
